  "description": "Yun Hyeok, a convenience store clerk who's been single his entire life, never expected much from life—until he hits the jackpot, literally. Winning the lottery and becoming a wealthy landlord overnight, he finally works up the courage to confess his feelings to his longtime crush. But there’s a catch—she’s only into men who wax. Determined to become her ideal type, Yun Hyeok heads to a waxing salon run by his old classmate, Lee Ha-eun. What starts as an awkward grooming session takes an unexpected turn when Ha-eun, noticing something…impressive, makes a shocking offer:\n\n*\"Would you like me to take care of this for you?\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
